<title>IRAQ: PRESS DIGEST - Iraq - Nov 15.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Iraq - Nov 15.</headline>
<dateline>BAGHDAD 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are some of the leading stories in the official Iraqi press on Friday. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>IRAQ</p>
<p>- A conference on the impact of U.N. trade sanctions on Iraqis to be held in Spain.</p>
<p>- Baghdad trade fair concludes today (Friday).</p>
<p>- Vice-president Taha Mohieddin Ma'rouf meets in Rome with Sudanese leader.</p>
<p>- Washington puts the wording for the Gulf states' summit before it is held.</p>
<p>(The above stories were also carried by THAWRA)</p>
